# trx64g.cor is TRX64-Ultimate's file (T239.3 D46): their CI packs it from the monolith bitstream and Gideon's Ultimate application of the same run
# (with tools/pack_import_cor.sh and tools/pack_large_cor.sh of this tree, copied with provenance), files it beside trx64u.cor in the same version
# of their generic package, and this package takes it by its sha256 and changes no byte (ci/imports.py pack copies it from the builder's store,
# finish checks it again). Shell variables. A later build is a new pin (VERSION, COR_FILE, COR_SHA256, COR_SIZE), reviewed.
# Where the registry is comes from the environment of the builder (ci/imports.py, TRX_FW_PKG_URL; T239.3 D45).
